    "body": "This marks the memory filled by the `getrandom` syscall as having been initialized when `os.getrandom()` is called. Without this, accessing this memory will cause a false positive when the memory sanitizer is enabled.\r\n\r\n<!-- gh-issue-number: gh-148850 -->\r\n* Issue: gh-148850\r\n<!-- /gh-issue-number -->\r\n",
